@architect-feature-plan @feat-spl-008
Feature: architect_feature_plan specialist tool — headless /feature-plan as an architect plan mode
  As the forge Mode P planner
  I want the local Architect specialist to turn a validated feature specification into the feature/task/wave YAML contract and its task documents, headlessly, with every planning preference resolved to a recorded default instead of a question
  So that autobuild receives a plan that passes the guardkit feature validate oracle without an attended Claude Code session, completing the local spec-to-plan chain

  Background:
    Given the architect role registers a plan mode named architect_feature_plan
    And the pinned /feature-plan methodology template is loadable from the installed guardkit package
    And a validated feature specification with its spec summary is supplied as the planning input

